gearwise (0.1.0~noble1) noble; urgency=medium

  * Initial release.
  * Logitech HID++ 2.0 (wired, Lightspeed/Unifying/Bolt, Bluetooth): DPI,
    report rate up to 8 kHz, lighting, per-key RGB, onboard profiles with
    button bindings, G-keys, battery.
  * Razer, Corsair (Bragi and legacy) and SteelSeries drivers.
  * Button assignments, macros (uinput playback) and profiles that follow
    every change and are re-applied when a device connects.
  * Model-accurate artwork for 27 mice and the Corsair K55 RGB PRO.

